      <dico>Lessing</dico>
      <unicode>ᠲᠠᠷᠴᠢᠺᠢᠨᠠᠬᠣ</unicode>
      <uighur>tarčikinaqu</uighur>
      <cyrillic>тарчигнах</cyrillic>
      <transcript>TARCIGINA-</transcript>
      <definition>[= tarzigina-, darcigina-] onomat. v. i. To rustle (of leaves); to knock, tap, clatter, stamp; to jar, rattle (from detonation).</definition>
      <page>780</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠮᠠᠰᠢᠨ ᠤ ᠳᠠᠭᠤᠤ ᠤᠯᠠᠨ ᠬᠤᠷᠳᠤᠨ ᠲᠠᠷᠴᠢᠺᠢᠨᠠᠪᠠ</unicode>
          <transcript>masin u daγuu ulam xurdun --ba</transcript>
          <definition> The engine chugged faster and faster.</definition>
        </example>
      </examples>
    </entry_item>
